{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7cfd5ff7-8c10-8082-a449-f9a8965b704a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T18:59:34-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Odete Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:57:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise. City Hall's closed for the night, but I'm here. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hi. Sorry, I know it's after hours, I saw the storm line number. I'm in a bank lobby waiting my turn, so if I [line breaks up] bad, tell me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I caught most of that. Go ahead, what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:57:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a tree down in the park, from last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. It's across the path by the, um, the old ball field. Well, it's not a ball field anymore, it's the open lawn part. Anyway, it's just lying there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:58:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Which park, do you know the name, or the street it's off of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:58:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's off Annandale Road, in the North End. I live at 420 Annandale. So who do I call about it? Where do I report a downed tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:58:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're doing it right now. I can take it down for Public Works. If it's on city parkland, the city handles it. If it's on private property, it's the owner. And if it's tangled in wires, that's the utility, and you shouldn't go near it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:58:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think there's wires. I can't tell. [inaudible] the branches are kind of leaning on the fence post, not the poles. Is it the city or the owner? I don't know whose land that is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:58:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since it's in a park, I'll log it as city land and the crew will confirm when they look at it. Is it blocking the path completely?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:59:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, all the way across. People walk their dogs there, kids cut through to school. I'm just worried somebody climbs on it or it shifts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I've got it as a downed tree across the walking path off Annandale Road, no wires seen. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:59:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:59:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0175. Keep people clear of it until the crew gets there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:59:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. They're calling me up now, I have to go. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:59:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take care, Odete."
    }
  ],
